   "content": {
    "type": "rendered",
    "raw": "##### ⚠️ Maintainability  \n\nThe Redis `keys` operation with pattern `installation:*;` is inefficient and blocks the Redis server - consider using `SCAN` for better performance in production.",
    "markup": "markdown",
    "html": "<h5 id=\"markdown-header-maintainability\">⚠️ Maintainability</h5>\n<p>The Redis <code>keys</code> operation with pattern <code>installation:*;</code> is inefficient and blocks the Redis server - consider using <code>SCAN</code> for better performance in production.</p>"
   },
