  {
   "id": 672856085,
   "created_on": "2025-08-21T09:11:56.871148+00:00",
   "updated_on": "2025-08-21T09:27:42.939185+00:00",
   "content": {
    "type": "rendered",
    "raw": "Yeah this is also my main concern - I couldn’t find a documented API to go from cloudId to baseUrl, which is why I implemented this way.\n\nI can look into this further tomorrow  \nEdit: Rovo says `There is no public Atlassian REST API that allows you to directly convert a cloudId to a baseUrl.`",
    "markup": "markdown",
    "html": "<p>Yeah this is also my main concern - I couldn’t find a documented API to go from cloudId to baseUrl, which is why I implemented this way.</p>\n<p>I can look into this further tomorrow<br>\nEdit: Rovo says <code>There is no public Atlassian REST API that allows you to directly convert a cloudId to a baseUrl.</code></p>"
   },
